      "writtenOn": "2020-12-09T03:08:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, sounds like the reasons the code was added in oom killer are mitigated by oom-reaper. Still I find it logical to thaw the process being killed to make sure it exists without a delay. Surely if you move this into __mark_oom_victim() then TIF_MEMDIE part should be moved along with it.",
